   $ N = floor.l p \/ k_0 floor.r \, wide B = N Q \, wide cal(E) = F_(*) cal(O)_W \( B \) \,\
wide s = p^4 = "rk" \( cal(E) \) \, wide R = s^t . $ <eq:frob-ranks>]
